title: Tabby Takes the Stage
id: tabby
tab: 04 · Tabby’s song
about: Patchwork soprano Tabby owns the pocket groove and crosses downstage past Neon, Watt, Cue, and Gruff with witty harmonies
lead: tabby
key: G major
bpm: 112
beat: B . t K | . t B . | t B . K | . B t . (swing 0.05)
backing: neon +0, watt +2, cue +4, gruff +2
stage: tabby, neon, cue, gruff, watt, clank
registers: tabby 0
breath: .25
finale: "Shine!" on 7

